OL,3,GNEWSAScotland has right to decide
OL,4,Aconstitutional future, new Scottish
OL,5,ALabour leader says
OL,6,
OL,7,FFirst Minister John Swinney insisted
OL,8,Fthat a majority of pro-independence
OL,9,FMSPs represented a mandate for a
OL,10,Freferendum - though Prime Minister Andy
OL,11,FBurnham has insisted such a vote is
OL,12,F"off limits".
